@startuml system-context
!include _theme.iuml

actor "Developer or analyst" as Person

rectangle "AI coding agent\nClaude, Codex, Gemini, Cursor, Copilot and others" as Agent

package "rup-flow" as Skill {
  rectangle "Skill\nSKILL.md and references" as Rules
  rectangle "CLI\nrup.mjs" as CLI
  rectangle "Templates and catalogue" as Templates
}

database "Project\nrup.config.json and the documentation folder" as Files
rectangle "PlantUML server\nlocal Docker container" as PlantUML

Person --> Agent : asks in plain language
Agent --> Rules : reads the rules
Agent --> CLI : runs commands
CLI --> Templates : fills
CLI --> Files : reads and writes
CLI --> PlantUML : diagram sources
PlantUML --> CLI : SVG
Agent --> Person : report of what was done,\nopen questions, unchecked items
@enduml
